{"seq":3,"slug":"document-generation-center","title":"单证统一生成与模板/数据复用","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/trade-document-center/trade-docs-suite/document-generation-center","wordCount":1553,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"单证统一生成与模板-数据复用\">单证统一生成与模板/数据复用</h1><p>一票货的十几份单证共享同一组事实，却各有各的版式、语言、印章要求——这是典型的**「一源多视图」（single source of truth, multiple renderings）**问题。糟糕的做法是让操作员在 Excel 里逐份填写，每份都手工敲一遍船名航次；正确的做法是维护一份权威数据，让每份单证成为它的一个渲染视图。本文讲这个单证中心（document center）的数据模型、渲染机制与版本管理，是本章唯一偏工程实现的一篇。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-事实核-视图定义\">核心概念：事实核 + 视图定义</h2><p>单证中心的数据分三层，层与层之间的依赖是单向的（视图依赖事实，事实不依赖视图）：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[交易 Trade&lt;br/&gt;合同条款·Incoterms·信用证] --&gt; B[事实核 Fact Core&lt;br/&gt;当事人·标的·数量·金额·运输]&#10;    B --&gt; C[单证实例 Document Instance]&#10;    D[模板 Template&lt;br/&gt;版式·字段映射·校验规则] --&gt; C&#10;    C --&gt; E[渲染产物 Rendering&lt;br/&gt;PDF·XML·纸质打印]&#10;    C --&gt; F[校验结果 Validation&lt;br/&gt;一致性·条款符合性]&#10;    E --&gt; G[交单 Presentation]\">graph TD\n    A[交易 Trade&lt;br/&gt;合同条款·Incoterms·信用证] --&gt; B[事实核 Fact Core&lt;br/&gt;当事人·标的·数量·金额·运输]\n    B --&gt; C[单证实例 Document Instance]\n    D[模板 Template&lt;br/&gt;版式·字段映射·校验规则] --&gt; C\n    C --&gt; E[渲染产物 Rendering&lt;br/&gt;PDF·XML·纸质打印]\n    C --&gt; F[校验结果 Validation&lt;br/&gt;一致性·条款符合性]\n    E --&gt; G[交单 Presentation]</pre><p>第一层是<strong>交易（Trade）</strong>：它承载合同与信用证的上层条款（付款方式、Incoterms、信用证编号、审批状态）。第二层是<strong>事实核（Fact Core）</strong>——即上一篇 <a href=\"document-suite-inventory\">合同/发票/装箱单/提单/产地证清单</a> 中定义的那组共享字段。第三层是<strong>单证实例</strong>：某份具体单证（如「本次交易的商业发票」）的状态、渲染产物、校验结果。</p>\n<p>关键设计决策：<strong>事实核是唯一可写的数据，单证实例只能从事实核派生</strong>。操作员永远不应该「直接编辑发票上的受益人名称」——他应该编辑事实核里的受益人名称，然后所有单证重新渲染。这一约束消灭了绝大部分「单证之间不一致」的缺陷类别：不一致的根因往往就是多处可写。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"interface TradeFactCore {&#10;  tradeRef: string;&#10;  seller: Party;&#10;  buyer: Party;&#10;  notifyParty: Party | null;&#10;  incoterm: string;&#10;  currency: string;&#10;  lineItems: LineItem[];&#10;  shipment: ShipmentLeg;&#10;  marks: string;&#10;  paymentTerms: PaymentTerms;&#10;}&#10;&#10;interface LineItem {&#10;  description: string;&#10;  hsCode: string;&#10;  quantity: number;&#10;  unit: string;&#10;  unitPriceMinor: number;&#10;  amountMinor: number;&#10;  originCountry: string;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> TradeFactCore</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  tradeRef</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  seller</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Party</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  buyer</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Party</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  notifyParty</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Party</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> null</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  incoterm</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  currency</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  lineItems</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> LineItem</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  shipment</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ShipmentLeg</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  marks</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  paymentTerms</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> PaymentTerms</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> LineItem</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  description</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  hsCode</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  quantity</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  unit</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  unitPriceMinor</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  amountMinor</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  originCountry</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"模板引擎-为什么不能硬编码版式\">模板引擎：为什么不能硬编码版式</h2><p>每份单证的版式是<strong>外部约束</strong>，不是内部设计：信用证指定了发票必须显示哪些字段、目的国海关指定了原产地证的表格样式、船公司有它自己的提单格式。硬编码版式意味着任何一处变更都要发版，而单证版式变更是高频的。</p>\n<p>模板需要具备四种能力：<strong>字段映射</strong>（把事实核的字段映射到版式位置）、<strong>条件渲染</strong>（某些字段仅当信用证有要求时显示）、<strong>计算字段</strong>（如合计金额、总毛重、集装箱数）、<strong>格式与本地化</strong>（日期格式、金额千分位、多语言标签）。选型上，HTML + CSS 打印（paged media）方案比 LaTeX 方案更适合——因为版式调整频繁、需要所见即所得，且 HTML 模板的迭代速度远高于 LaTeX，配合无头浏览器可直接产出 PDF。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"interface DocumentTemplate {&#10;  templateId: string;&#10;  documentType: DocumentType;&#10;  version: string;&#10;  fieldMappings: FieldMapping[];&#10;  computedFields: ComputedField[];&#10;  conditionalSections: ConditionalSection[];&#10;  requiredFields: string[];&#10;}&#10;&#10;interface FieldMapping {&#10;  target: string;&#10;  source: string;&#10;  formatter?: &#39;DATE_ISO&#39; | &#39;DATE_LOCALE&#39; | &#39;MONEY&#39; | &#39;UPPER&#39; | &#39;CN_NUM&#39;;&#10;  fallback?: string;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> DocumentTemplate</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  templateId</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  documentType</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> DocumentType</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  version</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  fieldMappings</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> FieldMapping</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  computedFields</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ComputedField</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  conditionalSections</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ConditionalSection</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  requiredFields</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> FieldMapping</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  target</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  source</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  formatter</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'DATE_ISO'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'DATE_LOCALE'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'MONEY'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'UPPER'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'CN_NUM'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  fallback</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>模板版本必须与渲染产物绑定</strong>：一份 2026-03 渲染的发票，必须能证明它当时用的是哪个模板版本。这不是为了合规洁癖，而是因为当银行说「你这份发票缺少信用证要求的 &#39;L/C No.&#39; 字段」时，你需要能区分「当时模板漏了」还是「当时信用证还没要求」。这直接连到 <a href=\"../trade-doc-risk/trade-doc-archive\">贸易单证存档与审计追溯</a> 的要求：渲染快照要连同模板版本一起持久化。</p>\n<h2 id=\"一致性校验-把人工比对变成可执行规则\">一致性校验：把人工比对变成可执行规则</h2><p>单证中心最大的价值不是省去打字，而是<strong>在交单之前自动发现不一致</strong>。人工比对三份单据的唛头是容易漏的，程序比对是确定性的。校验规则应当分两类：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>规则类别</th>\n<th>检查对象</th>\n<th>示例</th>\n<th>严重程度</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>内部一致性</td>\n<td>事实核与派生值</td>\n<td>装箱单件数之和 = 发票数量；单价×数量 = 金额</td>\n<td>ERROR</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>跨单证一致性</td>\n<td>两份单证之间</td>\n<td>发票受益人名称 ⊆ 提单托运人名称；唛头逐字相等</td>\n<td>ERROR</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>术语一致性</td>\n<td>单证与交易条款</td>\n<td>CIF 条款下必须有保险单且保额 ≥ 发票金额 110%</td>\n<td>WARN/ERROR</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>时间合理性</td>\n<td>日期链</td>\n<td>提单装船日期 ≤ 最迟装运期</td>\n<td>ERROR</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>格式合规</td>\n<td>字段本身</td>\n<td>HS 编码位数、币种代码在 ISO 4217 内</td>\n<td>WARN</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>规则引擎的设计要点是<strong>规则与数据分离</strong>：规则以配置（甚至以 DSL）表达，而不是散落在代码里。这样当信用证条款变化时，业务方可以自行调整规则而不必等发版——这与 <a href=\"../letter-of-credit/document-compliance-check\">单证严格相符审单</a> 的校验引擎是同一套机制，只是那篇把它对着信用证条款用，本篇把它对着内部一致性用。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"type ConsistencyRule = {&#10;  ruleId: string;&#10;  severity: &#39;ERROR&#39; | &#39;WARN&#39;;&#10;  when: (trade: TradeFactCore) =&gt; boolean;&#10;  check: (docs: DocumentInstance[]) =&gt; RuleViolation[];&#10;};\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">type</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ConsistencyRule</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  ruleId</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  severity</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'ERROR'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'WARN'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  when</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">trade</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> TradeFactCore</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> boolean</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  check</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">docs</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> DocumentInstance</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[]) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> RuleViolation</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">};</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"多语言-多币种与印章\">多语言、多币种与印章</h2><p>三个容易被低估的工程点。<strong>多语言</strong>：同一份单证发往不同国家可能要求不同语言（或中英双语），字段映射必须有 language 维度，且译文不能影响金额、日期、编号这类机器读取的字段。<strong>多币种</strong>：金额必须以最小货币单位（minor units，如美分）存储的整数表达，绝不用浮点数——浮点误差在金融场景是不可接受的，任何金额运算都应先归一到整数最小单位再做。<strong>印章与签名</strong>：纸质单证依赖公章、手签、骑缝章来证明真实性；系统化后需要用电子签名（数字证书）替代，且签名要绑定到<strong>渲染产物的哈希</strong>而不是数据库记录——因为对外呈现和司法举证的永远是被渲染出来的那个字节序列。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>单证中心的正确抽象是「一份权威事实核 + 若干声明式模板 + 一套可配置校验规则」。</li>\n<li>事实核是唯一可写层，单证只能从它派生——这一约束从根上消灭了「单证之间不一致」的缺陷类别。</li>\n<li>模板版本必须与渲染快照绑定，才能在事后举证时区分「模板漏了」与「当时还没要求」。</li>\n<li>校验规则要与规则数据分离，使其能随信用证条款演进而无需发版。</li>\n<li>金额一律以最小货币单位整数存储，印章与签名要绑定到渲染产物的哈希。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>生成与校验完成后，下一步是把它交给银行——请读 <a href=\"../letter-of-credit/lc-flow-parties\">信用证流程与开证/通知/议付各方</a> 了解对手方的角色，校验规则的条款侧用法见 <a href=\"../letter-of-credit/document-compliance-check\">单证严格相符审单</a>。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"单证统一生成与模板/数据复用","id":"单证统一生成与模板-数据复用"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：事实核 + 视图定义","id":"核心概念-事实核-视图定义"},{"level":2,"text":"模板引擎：为什么不能硬编码版式","id":"模板引擎-为什么不能硬编码版式"},{"level":2,"text":"一致性校验：把人工比对变成可执行规则","id":"一致性校验-把人工比对变成可执行规则"},{"level":2,"text":"多语言、多币种与印章","id":"多语言-多币种与印章"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"海运提单(B/L)物权凭证与电放","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/trade-document-center/trade-docs-suite/bill-of-lading"},"next":{"title":"信用证流程与开证/通知/议付各方","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/trade-document-center/letter-of-credit/lc-flow-parties"}}